>> title: Béchamel
>> category: Sauces & Gravies
>> tags: milk, roux, french, vegetarian, stovetop
>> counters: Pizzeria
>> aka: besciamella, white sauce
>> servings: 8
>> time: 25 min
>> slack: narrow — the milk goes in slowly against a whisk, because lumps that form here never dissolve however long it simmers

>> step: melt
Melt @unsalted butter{4%Tbs}(55 g) in a #heavy saucepan{} over medium-low heat.

>> step: cook roux 2 min
Cook @all-purpose flour{1/4%cup}(30 g) in @&(~1)butter{} for ~{2%min}, whisking, without letting it colour.

>> step: whisk in, simmer 10 min
Whisk @whole milk{2%cups}(475 mL; warmed) into @&(~1)roux{} a splash at a time, add @bay leaf{1}, and simmer for ~{10%min}.

>> step: season, pull the bay leaf
Season @&(~1)sauce{} with @kosher salt{3/4%tsp}, @white pepper{1/8%tsp}, and @grated nutmeg{1/8%tsp}, then pull the bay leaf.
